{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-markdown-remark-frontmatter-slug-tsx","path":"/lymphoma/2026-05-12/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Today, Mimi and I just met with my hemato-oncologist to review the results of <a href=\"/lymphoma/2026-05-07\">my last PET scan</a>. The doctor noticed that the PET scan showed a new area of increased metabolic activity... which she emphasized the illness doesn't wait.</p>\n<p>She indicated the same treatment plan as before: <strong><a href=\"/lymphoma/2025-09-18/\">K-GEMOX</a></strong>. I will be starting in 30 days from today, which is around June 12th.</p>\n<p>I asked how serious my situation is, and she said I'm not in a serious condition, but I need to start treatment at least within the next 30 days.</p>\n<h2>Next steps</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Continue to pray Jehovah for His peace, wisdom and strength.</li>\n<li>Submit the treatment plan to my insurance company for approval.\n<ul>\n<li>The chemotherapy drugs will be covered by my insurance.</li>\n<li>The inmunotherapy drug will not be covered by my insurance, so I will have to ask higher authorities for approval.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Have an hemogram test.</li>\n<li>Have a STRAIN electrocardiogram (ECG) test.</li>\n<li>Schedule another appointment with the oncologist to review the results of the ECG test and start the treatment plan.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Trust in Jehovah forever,\nFor Jah Jehovah is the eternal Rock.</p>\n<p>— <a href=\"https://www.jw.org/finder?wtlocale=E&#x26;pub=nwtsty&#x26;srctype=wol&#x26;bible=23026004&#x26;srcid=share\">Isaiah 26:4</a></p>\n</blockquote>","frontmatter":{"date":"2026-05-12T18:00:00.000Z","slug":"/lymphoma/2026-05-12","title":"Presenting the PET scan results to the oncologist","chapter":3}},"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2015-09-01"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-03"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-04"}}},{"node":{"front